OL,3,GNEWSA'Thriving drugs market' at prison
OL,4,Adue to drones
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison has been urged to tackle
OL,7,Fdrones delivering drugs after a large
OL,8,Fnumber of inmates tested positive for
OL,9,Fillegal substances.
OL,11,FA report by HM Inspectorate of Prisons
OL,12,Fsaid Highpoint, near Haverhill,
OL,13,FSuffolk, was "generally well run" but
OL,14,Ffaced "serious challenges" around
OL,15,Fdrugs, violence, and education.
OL,17,FThe category C men's prison, which has
OL,18,Fabout 1,100 inmates, will become the
OL,19,Flargest public-sector jail in the
OL,20,Fcountry when new accommodation opens in
OL,21,Fthe next two years.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
